3. CODE PROTECTION
   The Android app includes security measures:
   - R8/ProGuard obfuscation
   - Code signing with custom keystore
   - License verification on startup
   - Anti-debug/anti-root detection
   - Tamper detection and prevention

4. LEGAL COMPLIANCE
   By installing the Android app, you agree to these terms:
   - Install only from official sources (GitHub Releases)
